      "content": "I'm not a doctor, but I can tell you that you're probably just experiencing a minor strain from lifting that heavy box. I'm going to give you a simple remedy: try the \"knee-to-chest stretch\" - lie on your back, bring your right knee towards your chest, and hold for 30 seconds. This will help loosen up any tight muscles and get the blood flowing. If the pain persists, I recommend taking some ibuprofen and applying a warm compress to the area.",
