      "content": "okay, i'll stick to the warm bath. but i am getting a bit worried because the numbness is actually spreading to my toes and it feels like my foot is getting even heavier, like i can't really lift the front part of it when i walk. i read somewhere online that if you lose feeling or strength like this, it might be something serious like a pinched disc or even worse. are you sure i shouldn't at least get checked out at an urgent care? it feels a lot more intense than just a tight muscle.",
